# Chronology note

Before the reply, read `skills/record-chronology/SKILL.md` and `skills/record-chronology/references/note.md`.

When this turn changed the project or reached a result, write or update the note for this window. Do not wait to be asked. A question that did not change the project and did not reach a result writes nothing.

Do not write the transcript. Do not write a secret, a token, or the contents of an env file. The same window keeps the same file. At most two sections per UTC day. A missing `git config user.name` skips the note and does not invent a folder.
